  "summary": "With +18 years of experience in Java development and a strong background in IBM FileNet solutions, I specialize in designing and building enterprise-grade applications. In recent years, I’ve focused on transforming legacy monolithic applications into scalable microservices architectures, enabling businesses to enhance agility, performance, and maintainability.\n\nI take pride in solving complex architectural challenges, optimizing system performance, and guiding teams to deliver clean, maintainable solutions. My expertise includes integrating modern microservices with legacy systems, developing RESTful APIs, and ensuring seamless system integrations across platforms.\nKey Areas of Expertise:\n+ Java (Core, EE, Spring Framework, Spring Boot, Spring Cloud)\n+ .NET(C#)\n+ Database (Oracle, MS SQL Server, DB2, Postgres, MySQL, MongoDB, Redis)\n+ Source Control (Git, SVN)\n+ IBM FileNet (P8, Content Engine, Process Engine, Case Manager, Content Navigator)\n+ IBM Datacap 9.x\n+ Microservices architecture & development (Kubernetes, Helm, Docker)\n+ Grpc\n+ RESTful APIs & system integrations\n+ Performance tuning & optimization\n+ Enterprise architecture and solution design\n+ Technical mentoring & leadership\n\nI’m passionate about building scalable, future-proof systems and helping organizations navigate digital transformation. Always eager to connect with professionals who share a focus on innovative solutions and efficient system design.",
